+→ Test Files 38 passed (38), Tests 283 passed (283). 38 = every *.test.ts on disk, including the new file.
+
+`npx tsc --noEmit`
+→ no output (exit 0).
+
+Not run (the sandbox denied these commands): running only the new test file, and `git stash` to
+confirm the new test fails on the old code.
